OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage affected
OL,4,ASouth East NHS trusts, councils and
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday morning, NHS trusts across
OL,8,FSurrey, East and West Sussex, and Kent
OL,9,Freported issues receiving and sending
OL,10,Femails, while some said patient
OL,11,Finquiries and referral correspondences
OL,12,Fwere also affected.
OL,14,FPatients had been urged to contact NHS
OL,15,Ftrusts by phone and to continue to
OL,16,Fattend planned appointments.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
